# User-supplied Toptal guide PDFs

The **Toptal pack** ships extraction tooling only — each user provides their own copies of the official Toptal PDF guides.

## Required PDFs

Drop these files in this folder (`sources/toptal-guides/pdf/`):

| File | Extract output |
|------|----------------|
| `Job Application Matching Process Handbook for Developers.pdf` | `../job-application-matching-handbook.md` |
| `Developer - Profile Creation Guide.pdf` | `../developer-profile-creation-guide.md` |

Obtain the PDFs from your Toptal account or recruiter. Do not commit them to a public repository.

## Extract

After adding PDFs:

```bash
pnpm extract-toptal-guides
```

Then run `pnpm validate` to confirm extracts exist.

If PDFs are missing, Toptal skills fall back to `sources/toptal-best-practices.md` (degraded mode).
